{"title":"KILLOVE FIREPROOF!","artist":"아카츠키 레코즈, 동방영야초","sourceId":"reference:lKyZN3MzzudcZAnB93kP","sourceHash":"a74004d4d0f8afcfea3c1d0a3748965dd30be6e65b5407088c100204df002950","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":1038292,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.32,"end":5.5,"text":"触れても、壊れぬ愛で 生き死に輪廻りんねを超えて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":5.5,"end":12.84,"text":"永久とわに燃えさかる愛で あなたを殺しましょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":12.84,"end":17.42,"text":"Are you ready to die? I wanna die with you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":17.42,"end":18.57,"text":"KilLove Fireproof!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":18.57,"end":21.39,"text":"Let's kill each other Red punishment fire","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":21.39,"end":24.2,"text":"Kill me, give me some mercy Kill-kill-kill and Love!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":24.2,"end":26.92,"text":"愛するもの 信じるもの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":26.92,"end":30.03,"text":"すべて朽ちて, 失われるもの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":30.03,"end":35.73,"text":"抱きしめてもいずれ灰となる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":35.73,"end":38.6,"text":"死は救いか？死は報いか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":38.6,"end":41.8,"text":"生きることが呪いであるから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":41.8,"end":47.86,"text":"人は涙を流し、生まれるのだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":47.86,"end":50.76,"text":"Aaaaah, aaaaah","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":50.76,"end":53.84,"text":"Aaaaah, aaaaah","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":53.84,"end":56.41,"text":"Aaaaah, aaaaah","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":56.41,"end":58.07,"text":"Aaaaah","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":58.07,"end":59.61,"text":"Killove Fireproof!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":59.61,"end":62.52,"text":"闇夜を照らせ命よ (aaaaah, fire)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":62.52,"end":65.44,"text":"(Aaaaah, aaaaah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":65.44,"end":68.34,"text":"産声掻かき消せ炎 (aaaah, aaaaah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":68.34,"end":69.81,"text":"(Aaaaah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":69.81,"end":71.36,"text":"Killove Fireproof!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":71.36,"end":75.28,"text":"月夜にうたえ命よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":75.28,"end":77.14,"text":"Ah-ah, ah-ah","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":77.14,"end":81.37,"text":"この身を焦がして炎","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":81.37,"end":87.05,"text":"Ah-ah, ah-ah","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":87.05,"end":94.4,"text":"Ah-ah, ah-ah","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":94.4,"end":100.42,"text":"私をひとり、残して死なないと誓え","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":100.42,"end":106.06,"text":"私をひとり、生かしはしないことを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":106.06,"end":112.38,"text":"あなたをひとり、逝かせはしないと誓う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":112.38,"end":118.15,"text":"耐火の愛で あなたを殺すのは私だけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":130.25,"end":136.37,"text":"(Aaaaah, aaaaah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":136.37,"end":142.0,"text":"(Aaaaah, aaaaah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":142.0,"end":147.87,"text":"(Aaaaah, aaaaah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":147.87,"end":153.64,"text":"Killove Fireproof! Killove Fireproof!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":153.64,"end":154.1,"text":"(Aaaaah, aaaaah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":154.1,"end":159.67000000000002,"text":"かごめかごめ 籠の中の鳥は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":159.67000000000002,"end":165.76,"text":"いついつ出逢う (いついつ出逢う)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":165.76,"end":171.53,"text":"夜明けの晚に 鶴と亀が滑った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":171.53,"end":177.5,"text":"後ろの正面だあれ？ 後ろの正面だあれ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":177.5,"end":179.15,"text":"「不死の火に燃え尽きぬ咎人とがにんよ、永遠の監獄に遊ぶ不死の魂よ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":179.15,"end":180.51,"text":"「月明かりに浮かぶ首無しの不死鳥よ 人の輪廻捨てし 忘却の魂よ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":180.51,"end":181.87,"text":"「その美しき罪を重ね 死を重ね 死を重ね」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":181.87,"end":183.32,"text":"「生き永らえる苦痛を重ね 死を重ね 死を重ね」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":183.32,"end":184.66,"text":"「それでもまた 生きて生きて生きて生きて生きて」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":184.66,"end":186.29,"text":"「それでもまた 生きて生きて生きて生きて」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":186.29,"end":187.8,"text":"「この世が無に帰しても私達はこの意識と肉体にとどまるだろう」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":187.8,"end":189.17,"text":"「月が地に落ちても私達はこの意識と肉体にとどまるでしょう」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":189.17,"end":190.61,"text":"「だれひとりいなくなっても、全ての光が消えたとしても」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":190.61,"end":192.23,"text":"「だれひとりいなくなっても、全ての光が消えたとしても」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":192.23,"end":193.51,"text":"「だから、何度でも殺してやる」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":193.51,"end":195.11,"text":"「だから、何度でも殺してあげる」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":195.11,"end":198.09,"text":"「私がおまえを何度でも殺してやるから」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":198.09,"end":200.9,"text":"「私があなたを何度でも殺してあげるから」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":200.9,"end":206.85,"text":"永遠を共に生き死ぬ Fireproof!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":206.85,"end":212.95,"text":"億永劫えいごうの愛 大火の抱擁 燃え上がれ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":212.95,"end":218.46,"text":"ああ二人で 受け止めて Killove Fireproof!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":218.46,"end":222.75,"text":"耐火の愛で 殺して、愛して、","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":222.75,"end":224.57999999999998,"text":"涅槃さいごまで！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":224.57999999999998,"end":230.22,"text":"Yeah-yeah Love me, love me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":230.22,"end":235.72,"text":"Yeah-yeah Kill KILLove Fireproof!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":235.72,"end":241.83,"text":"Yeah-yeah Kill me, kill me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":241.83,"end":247.98,"text":"Yeah-yeah Kill KILLove Fireproof!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}